Users had no quick way to return to dashboard from nested pages and received no confirmation when performing CRUD operations (save, delete, assign).

## Changes

### 1. Header Navigation
- Added conditional "🏠 Inicio" button to header (hidden on dashboard)
- Restructured header layout with flexbox for button positioning
- CSS: `.header-content`, `.btn-home` with semi-transparent styling

### 2. Flash Message System
- Added success/error message display between header and main content
- CSS: `.flash-message`, `.flash-success`, `.flash-error` with slide-down animation
- Messages dismissible via close button (×)

### 3. Controller Updates (11 files)
All controllers now use `RedirectAttributes` to pass feedback messages:

```java
@PostMapping("/guardar")
public String guardarMarca(@ModelAttribute Marca marca, RedirectAttributes redirectAttributes) {
    marcaRepository.save(marca);
    redirectAttributes.addFlashAttribute("mensaje", "✅ Marca guardada correctamente");
    return "redirect:/marcas";
}

@GetMapping("/borrar/{id}")
public String borrarMarca(@PathVariable Integer id, RedirectAttributes redirectAttributes) {
    try {
        marcaRepository.deleteById(id);
        redirectAttributes.addFlashAttribute("mensaje", "✅ Marca eliminada correctamente");
    } catch (Exception e) {
        redirectAttributes.addFlashAttribute("error", "❌ Error: La marca tiene modelos asociados y no se puede eliminar");
    }
    return "redirect:/marcas";
}
```

